Support local and celebrate community this season!

The holidays are all about community — whether it’s gathering around the table for an intimate dinner or cozying up for movie nights with loved ones. But another beautiful way to celebrate community is by supporting the local shops that make our neighbourhoods so special!

As you check off your gift list, treat yourself to a festive hot chocolate and explore these charming local businesses across Ontario. Not only will you discover one-of-a-kind treasures, but you’ll also be spreading cheer to the hardworking small business owners in your community.

And here’s a bonus: Beautiful Everydays is available at all of these local shops — perfect for gifting someone (or yourself!) a cozy guide to help you spend less time on your phone and more time living in the here and now this holiday season.

Pop into any of these (and please say hello from us if you do— we are so grateful to all of them for their support)!

